<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>UniTrade UEH - Nền tảng trao đổi & mua bán nội bộ sinh viên UEH</title>
    <!-- Bootstrap 5.3 CSS -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Font Awesome 6.5 -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts: Inter -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --ueh-teal: #005F6B;
            --ueh-dark: #00424B;
            --ueh-light: #E6F2F4;
            --ueh-orange: #F26522;
            --ueh-orange-hover: #D95314;
            --ueh-orange-light: #FFF3EC;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: #F4F7F8;
            color: #1E293B;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        /* Banner UEH */
        .ueh-top-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(95deg, #003840 0%, #005F6B 50%, #007585 78%, #F26522 100%);
            color: #fff;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .ueh-top-banner::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.14) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 16px 16px;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* Logo hộp chuẩn nhận diện UEH */
        .ueh-brand-box {
            background-color: var(--ueh-teal);
            border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            display: inline-flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            line-height: 1;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
        }
        .ueh-brand-box .ueh-text {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .ueh-brand-box .uni-text {
            color: var(--ueh-orange);
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 0.52rem;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        /* Thanh điều hướng chính */
        .ueh-navbar {
            background-color: var(--ueh-dark);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        }
        .ueh-nav-btn {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.88);
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            border-bottom: 3px solid transparent;
            padding: 11px 15px;
            font-size: 0.84rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            white-space: nowrap;
            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .ueh-nav-btn:hover {
            color: #fff;
            background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        }
        .ueh-nav-btn.active {
            color: #fff;
            background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.16);
            border-bottom-color: var(--ueh-orange);
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* Màu nút & badge */
        .btn-ueh-teal {
            background-color: var(--ueh-teal);
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 600;
            border: none;
        }
        .btn-ueh-teal:hover {
            background-color: var(--ueh-dark);
            color: #fff;
        }
        .btn-ueh-orange {
            background-color: var(--ueh-orange);
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 600;
            border: none;
        }
        .btn-ueh-orange:hover {
            background-color: var(--ueh-orange-hover);
            color: #fff;
        }
        .btn-outline-ueh {
            border: 1.5px solid var(--ueh-teal);
            color: var(--ueh-teal);
            font-weight: 600;
            background-color: #fff;
        }
        .btn-outline-ueh:hover {
            background-color: var(--ueh-teal);
            color: #fff;
        }

        /* Danh mục sản phẩm */
        .category-item-card {
            background: #fff;
            border: 1.5px solid #E2E8F0;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 13px 14px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }
        .category-item-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--ueh-teal);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(0, 95, 107, 0.08);
        }
        .category-item-card.active {
            border-color: var(--ueh-teal);
            background-color: var(--ueh-light);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 95, 107, 0.14);
        }
        .category-icon-box {
            width: 46px;
            height: 46px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background-color: var(--ueh-light);
            color: var(--ueh-teal);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        /* Thẻ sản phẩm */
        .product-card {
            background: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
            border-radius: 14px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: all 0.22s ease;
            height: 100%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }
        .product-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.09);
            border-color: var(--ueh-teal);
        }
        .product-img-wrap {
            position: relative;
            height: 185px;
            background-color: #F8FAFC;
            overflow: hidden;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .product-img-wrap img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }
        .product-card:hover .product-img-wrap img {
            transform: scale(1.04);
        }

        /* Upload hình ảnh ở trang Đăng tin */
        .upload-dropzone {
            border: 2px dashed #CBD5E1;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background-color: #F8FAFC;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            min-height: 200px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 16px;
        }
        .upload-dropzone:hover, .upload-dropzone.dragover {
            border-color: var(--ueh-teal);
            background-color: var(--ueh-light);
        }
        .thumb-slot {
            aspect-ratio: 1/1;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 1.5px dashed #CBD5E1;
            background: #F8FAFC;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .thumb-slot img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        /* Khung quét mã vạch sách */
        .barcode-scanner-box {
            border: 2px dashed var(--ueh-orange);
            border-radius: 14px;
            background-color: var(--ueh-orange-light);
            padding: 16px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .scanner-laser {
            height: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #EF4444, transparent);
            width: 100%;
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            animation: scanLaser 1.2s infinite ease-in-out;
        }
        @keyframes scanLaser {
            0% { top: 10%; }
            50% { top: 90%; }
            100% { top: 10%; }
        }
        
        /* Hiệu ứng focus cho camera */
        .camera-overlay-focus {
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 9999px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        /* Nút Google chuẩn */
        .btn-google-auth {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #3c4043;
            border: 1.5px solid #dadce0;
            border-radius: 50px;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .btn-google-auth:hover {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            border-color: #c6c9cc;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
        }

        /* Hiệu ứng Shipper trên bản đồ */
        @keyframes pulseOrange {
            0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(242, 101, 34, 0.7); }
            70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 12px rgba(242, 101, 34, 0); }
            100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(242, 101, 34, 0); }
        }
        .shipper-badge-pulse {
            animation: pulseOrange 2s infinite;
        }

        /* Ẩn thanh cuộn ngang trên mobile */
        .no-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {
            display: none;
        }
        .no-scrollbar {
            -ms-overflow-style: none;
            scrollbar-width: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- ==================== HEADER & THANH ĐIỀU HƯỚNG ==================== -->
    <header class="sticky-top shadow-sm z-3">
        <div class="ueh-top-banner py-2 px-3">
            <div class="container-xl d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2 position-relative z-1">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3" style="cursor:pointer" onclick="switchTab('home')">
                    <div class="ueh-brand-box">
                        <span class="ueh-text">UEH</span>
                        <span class="uni-text">UNIVERSITY</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                            <span class="fw-bolder fs-4 text-white tracking-tight">UniTrade</span>
                            <span class="badge rounded-pill" style="background-color: var(--ueh-orange); font-size: 0.68rem;">CHỢ ĐỒ CŨ UEH</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-white-50" style="font-size: 0.74rem;">Sàn giao dịch đồ cũ sinh viên UEH</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="text-center">
                    <div class="fw-bolder text-uppercase" style="font-size: 0.95rem; letter-spacing: 0.4px;">
                        <span class="text-white">UniTrade UEH - </span>
                        <span class="text-warning">NỀN TẢNG TRAO ĐỔI & MUA BÁN NỘI BỘ UEH</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="d-none d-sm-flex justify-content-center gap-3 mt-1" style="font-size: 0.73rem; color: #E2F1F3;">
                        <span><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap text-warning me-1"></i>Xác thực @st.ueh.edu.vn</span>
                        <span><i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot text-warning me-1"></i>Giao nhận Cơ sở A, B, N</span>
                        <span><i class="fa-solid fa-repeat text-warning me-1"></i>Vừa là Người Mua - Vừa là Người Bán</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="d-none d-lg-flex align-items-center">
                    <span id="topStatusBadge" class="badge bg-dark bg-opacity-50 border border-light border-opacity-25 px-3 py-2 fw-normal" style="font-size: 0.74rem;">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-lock text-warning me-1"></i>Chưa đăng nhập
                    </span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Thanh Điều Hướng Chính -->
        <nav class="ueh-navbar">
            <div class="container-xl d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between px-2 px-sm-3">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center overflow-auto no-scrollbar pt-1 gap-1">
                    <button id="nav-home" class="ueh-nav-btn active" onclick="switchTab('home')">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-house me-1"></i>Trang chủ
                    </button>
                    <button id="nav-sell" class="ueh-nav-btn" onclick="switchTab('sell')">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-plus me-1" style="color: var(--ueh-orange);"></i>ĐĂNG TIN PASS ĐỒ
                    </button>
                    <button id="nav-cart" class="ueh-nav-btn" onclick="switchTab('cart')">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-cart-shopping me-1"></i>GIỎ HÀNG CỦA TÔI
                        <span id="cartBadge" class="badge rounded-pill ms-1" style="background-color: var(--ueh-orange);">0</span>
                    </button>
                    <button id="nav-messages" class="ueh-nav-btn" onclick="switchTab('messages')">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-comment-dots me-1"></i>TIN NHẮN
                        <span class="badge rounded-pill ms-1" style="background-color: var(--ueh-orange);">3</span>
                    </button>
                    <button id="nav-orders" class="ueh-nav-btn" onclick="switchTab('orders')">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-truck-fast me-1"></i>ĐƠN HÀNG
                        <span id="orderBadge" class="badge rounded-pill bg-info text-dark ms-1">2</span>
                    </button>
                    <button id="nav-account" class="ueh-nav-btn" onclick="switchTab('account')">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-user-graduate me-1"></i>TÀI KHOẢN CỦA TÔI
                    </button>
                </div>

                <div class="ps-2 py-1 flex-shrink-0">
                    <div id="guestAuthArea" class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <button onclick="openAuthModal('login')" class="btn btn-sm btn-light fw-bold px-3 rounded-pill shadow-sm" style="color: var(--ueh-teal); font-size: 0.78rem;">
                            <i class="fa-regular fa-user me-1"></i>ĐĂNG NHẬP
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="openAuthModal('register')" class="btn btn-sm btn-ueh-orange fw-bold px-3 rounded-pill shadow-sm" style="font-size: 0.78rem;">
                            ĐĂNG KÝ
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <div id="userLoggedArea" class="d-none align-items-center gap-2">
                        <div onclick="switchTab('account')" class="bg-white text-dark rounded-pill px-3 py-1 d-flex align-items-center gap-2 shadow-sm border" style="cursor:pointer;">
                            <img id="headerUserAvatar" src="" alt="Avatar" class="rounded-circle" style="width: 28px; height: 28px; object-fit: cover; border: 2px solid var(--ueh-teal);">
                            <div class="lh-1 text-start d-none d-sm-block">
                                <div id="headerUserName" class="fw-bold" style="font-size: 0.76rem;">Sinh viên UEH</div>
                                <small id="headerUserMethod" class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.65rem;">@st.ueh.edu.vn</small>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <button onclick="logoutUser()" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-light rounded-pill px-2 py-1" title="Đăng xuất tài khoản" style="font-size: 0.75rem;">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-right-from-bracket"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- ==================== NỘI DUNG CHÍNH ==================== -->
    <main class="container-xl py-4 flex-grow-1">

        <!-- ================================================================= -->
        <!-- 1. TRANG CHỦ                                                      -->
        <!-- ================================================================= -->
        <section id="tab-home" class="tab-pane-section">
            <div class="row justify-content-center mb-4">
                <div class="col-12 col-lg-10">
                    <div class="bg-white p-2 rounded-pill shadow-sm border d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="ps-3 text-secondary"><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass fs-5"></i></span>
                        <input id="searchInput" type="text" oninput="renderHomeProducts()" class="form-control border-0 shadow-none" placeholder="Tìm kiếm giáo trình UEH, tài liệu A4, áo thun đồng phục UEH, đồ dùng phòng trọ...">
                        <select id="campusFilterSelect" onchange="renderHomeProducts()" class="form-select border-0 bg-light rounded-pill d-none d-md-block" style="max-width: 210px; font-size: 0.84rem; font-weight: 600;">
                            <option value="all">Tất cả Cơ sở UEH</option>
                            <option value="Cơ sở A">Cơ sở A (Quận 3)</option>
                            <option value="Cơ sở B">Cơ sở B (Quận 10)</option>
                            <option value="Cơ sở N">Cơ sở N (Nam TP)</option>
                        </select>
                        <button onclick="renderHomeProducts()" class="btn btn-ueh-teal rounded-pill px-4 py-2 flex-shrink-0">
                            Tìm kiếm
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mb-4">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-2">
                    <h6 class="fw-bold mb-0 text-secondary text-uppercase" style="font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group me-1" style="color: var(--ueh-teal);"></i>Danh mục sản phẩm sinh viên
                    </h6>
                    <button id="resetCatBtn" onclick="filterByCategory('all')" class="btn btn-link btn-sm text-decoration-none p-0 d-none fw-bold" style="color: var(--ueh-orange);">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left me-1"></i>Xem tất cả danh mục
                    </button>
                </div>

                <div class="row g-2 g-md-3 row-cols-2 row-cols-sm-3 row-cols-lg-5">
                    <div class="col">
                        <div id="cat-Sách & Giáo trình" onclick="filterByCategory('Sách & Giáo trình')" class="category-item-card">
                            <div class="category-icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i></div>
                            <div class="overflow-hidden">
                                <div class="fw-bold text-dark text-truncate" style="font-size: 0.88rem;">Giáo trình & Sách</div>
                                <div class="text-muted text-truncate" style="font-size: 0.74rem;">Sách vở các khoa UEH</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col">
                        <div id="cat-Tài liệu A4" onclick="filterByCategory('Tài liệu A4')" class="category-item-card">
                            <div class="category-icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-lines"></i></div>
                            <div class="overflow-hidden">
                                <div class="fw-bold text-dark text-truncate" style="font-size: 0.88rem;">Tài liệu A4</div>
                                <div class="text-muted text-truncate" style="font-size: 0.74rem;">Đề cương, ghi chú</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col">
                        <div id="cat-Đồ dùng nhà bếp" onclick="filterByCategory('Đồ dùng nhà bếp')" class="category-item-card">
                            <div class="category-icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-kitchen-set"></i></div>
                            <div class="overflow-hidden">
                                <div class="fw-bold text-dark text-truncate" style="font-size: 0.88rem;">Đồ dùng nhà bếp</div>
                                <div class="text-muted text-truncate" style="font-size: 0.74rem;">Bếp, nồi cơm, ấm đun</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col">
                        <div id="cat-Đồ dùng phòng ngủ" onclick="filterByCategory('Đồ dùng phòng ngủ')" class="category-item-card">
                            <div class="category-icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-bed"></i></div>
                            <div class="overflow-hidden">
                                <div class="fw-bold text-dark text-truncate" style="font-size: 0.88rem;">Đồ dùng phòng ngủ</div>
                                <div class="text-muted text-truncate" style="font-size: 0.74rem;">Đèn học, bàn, chăn ga</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col col-12 col-sm-4 col-lg">
                        <div id="cat-Quần áo & Phụ kiện" onclick="filterByCategory('Quần áo & Phụ kiện')" class="category-item-card">
                            <div class="category-icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-shirt"></i></div>
                            <div class="overflow-hidden">
                                <div class="fw-bold text-dark text-truncate" style="font-size: 0.88rem;">Quần áo & Phụ kiện</div>
                                <div class="text-muted text-truncate" style="font-size: 0.74rem;">Áo UEH, balo, giày</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div>
                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2 mb-3">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <h4 class="fw-bolder mb-0 text-dark">Đồ mới đăng</h4>
                        <span class="badge rounded-pill px-3 py-1" style="background-color: var(--ueh-orange-light); color: var(--ueh-orange); border: 1px solid rgba(242,101,34,0.3);">
                            <i class="fa-regular fa-clock me-1"></i>Mới đăng 1 - 2 ngày trước
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.8rem;">
                        Hiển thị trực tiếp hình ảnh, giá bán và họ tên sinh viên đăng bán
                    </span>
                </div>

                <div id="homeProductsGrid" class="row g-3 row-cols-1 row-cols-sm-2 row-cols-md-3 row-cols-lg-5">
                    <!-- Được render tự động bằng JS -->
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ================================================================= -->
        <!-- 2. ĐĂNG TIN PASS ĐỒ (MAX 5 ẢNH + BƯỚC 5 QUÉT MÃ VẠCH SÁCH)         -->
        <!-- ================================================================= -->
        <section id="tab-sell" class="tab-pane-section d-none">
            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 p-3 p-md-4 mx-auto" style="max-width: 980px;">
                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2 pb-3 border-bottom">
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="fw-bolder mb-1">Đăng Tin Pass Đồ Mới</h4>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0" style="font-size: 0.85rem;">Tải hình chụp món đồ của bạn lên (tối đa 5 ảnh) và đăng bán cho cộng đồng sinh viên UEH</p>
                    </div>
                    <span class="badge px-3 py-2 rounded-pill" style="background-color: var(--ueh-light); color: var(--ueh-teal);">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-camera me-1"></i>Tối đa 5 ảnh / sản phẩm
                    </span>
                </div>

                <!-- Thanh 5 bước -->
                <div class="my-4 px-2 px-md-5">
